1
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,230
Bu! Aku buka lemari,

2
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,970
jaketnya dingin banget!

3
00:00:17,967 --> 00:00:21,347
Bukannya jaket itu hangat? Kok dingin?

4
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:25,893
Tenang dulu. Pegang tanganmu, hangat, kan?

5
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:30,090
Iya. Tapi tak pakai listrik,

6
00:00:30,133 --> 00:00:32,453
kok sebentar langsung hangat?

7
00:00:33,767 --> 00:00:36,197
Panasnya dari mana?

8
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:39,717
Jawabannya lebih dekat dari dugaanmu.

9
00:00:40,667 --> 00:00:44,017
Tebak dulu: es batu dibungkus jaket,

10
00:00:44,533 --> 00:00:47,423
lelehnya lebih cepat atau lambat?

11
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:53,367
Lalu, kenapa pagar besi taman terasa
lebih dingin dari bangku kayu?

12
00:00:54,533 --> 00:00:58,063
Dan kenapa jaket yang
basah langsung tak hangat?

13
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,100
Jaketnya dingin, kok jadi hangat?

14
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:06,960
Coba deh: taruh termometer
di dalam jaket semalaman.

15
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:12,010
Pagi, suhunya sama kamar.

16
00:01:12,133 --> 00:01:13,693
Tidak lebih hangat?

17
00:01:14,867 --> 00:01:18,087
Jadi dinginnya sama kayak kursi?

18
00:01:18,967 --> 00:01:24,427
Ya. Kursi, meja, jaket ini,
lama-lama sama dengan kamar.

19
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:26,823
Kamarnya lebih dingin dari tanganmu.

20
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:31,393
Pasti ada pemanas di dalamnya!

21
00:01:32,133 --> 00:01:36,433
Wajar, rasanya memang seperti memanas.

22
00:01:36,433 --> 00:01:39,743
Tapi isinya cuma bulu angsa dan kain.

23
00:01:40,733 --> 00:01:44,093
Kalau ia pemanas,
termometernya pasti naik.

24
00:01:45,367 --> 00:01:47,237
Mana pemanasnya?

25
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,270
Kamu.

26
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:51,160
Kamulah pemanasnya.

27
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:55,733
Aku? Tapi tak ada api di badanku.

28
00:01:55,733 --> 00:01:57,873
Tubuh memakai makananmu.

29
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:01,810
Makan itu menambah kayu bakar?

30
00:02:02,433 --> 00:02:03,943
Kira-kira.

31
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,460
Energinya sebagian besar jadi panas.

32
00:02:08,267 --> 00:02:12,747
Orang dewasa duduk diam
melepas sekitar 100 watt,

33
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:15,883
seperti bohlam model lama.

34
00:02:16,733 --> 00:02:19,033
Jadi aku juga bohlam?

35
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,100
Anak melepas lebih sedikit,

36
00:02:23,467 --> 00:02:27,787
tapi terus melepas; saat tidur
pun hanya sedikit berkurang.

37
00:02:29,567 --> 00:02:31,997
Kalau aku menggigil kedinginan?

38
00:02:33,467 --> 00:02:35,547
Tubuh jadi lebih panas.

39
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:39,610
Menggigil bisa melepas
panas beberapa kali lipat.

40
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:44,430
Jadi kalau menggigil, bilang:

41
00:02:44,833 --> 00:02:46,763
Pemanasku sedang lembur!

42
00:02:48,133 --> 00:02:50,363
Panasku keluar terus,

43
00:02:50,733 --> 00:02:52,473
kok masih kedinginan?

44
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,100
Sifat panas:

45
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,360
selalu dari yang panas ke yang dingin.

46
00:02:59,533 --> 00:03:03,493
Saat memegang cokelat panas,
panas masuk ke tanganmu.

47
00:03:04,967 --> 00:03:09,017
Pegang es, tangan jadi
dingin, esnya meleleh.

48
00:03:09,533 --> 00:03:12,043
Esnya mengirim dingin ke aku?

49
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:16,820
Terbalik: panas tanganmu yang masuk ke es.

50
00:03:17,367 --> 00:03:20,477
Yang pindah itu panas, bukan dingin.

51
00:03:21,267 --> 00:03:23,817
Panas tak bisa balik arah?

52
00:03:24,267 --> 00:03:26,727
Es tak bikin tanganmu hangat.

53
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:33,440
Kaki telanjang di keramik:
panas kaki pindah ke lantai.

54
00:03:34,700 --> 00:03:36,670
Di karpet aman,

55
00:03:37,033 --> 00:03:38,943
kok keramik dingin?

56
00:03:39,767 --> 00:03:41,587
Nanti di taman terjawab.

57
00:03:43,367 --> 00:03:47,217
Jadi dingin itu panas yang terus kabur?

58
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:50,840
Ya. Baju cuma memperlambat panas kabur.

59
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:54,200
Pagar besinya dingin banget!

60
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,400
Bangku kayunya biasa saja.

61
00:03:58,567 --> 00:04:00,677
Besi lebih dingin, kan?

62
00:04:01,367 --> 00:04:05,867
Kedengarannya benar. Tapi
semalaman mereka di sana,

63
00:04:06,433 --> 00:04:09,153
jadi dinginnya hampir sama.

64
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:13,050
Masa? Rasanya beda jauh!

65
00:04:14,533 --> 00:04:16,500
Tangan menipu.

66
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:20,040
Ia merasakan secepat apa panas kabur.

67
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:25,670
Besi membawa panas tanganmu
dengan cepat, kayu lambat.

68
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:29,720
Baja ratusan kali lebih cepat dari kayu.

69
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:36,670
Karpet dan keramik sama: keramik
lebih cepat membawa panas kaki.

70
00:04:37,433 --> 00:04:39,863
Ritsletingnya juga lebih dingin!

71
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:45,250
Pegang sebentar, sudah
tak dingin: panasmu masuk.

72
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,050
Kalau pegang yang dingin, pikir:

73
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:54,260
Memang lebih dingin, atau
pandai membawa panas?

74
00:04:55,267 --> 00:04:57,277
Penahan panas terbaik?

75
00:04:58,100 --> 00:05:03,600
Mungkin kamu kaget: penahan
panas terbaik itu udara.

76
00:05:04,333 --> 00:05:07,963
Udara? Kita tiap hari hidup di udara!

77
00:05:08,533 --> 00:05:11,423
Panas sulit lewat udara diam.

78
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:14,270
Masalahnya, udara sulit diam.

79
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,420
Kenapa bergerak?

80
00:05:17,967 --> 00:05:20,727
Udara dekat tubuhmu hangat lalu naik,

81
00:05:21,867 --> 00:05:24,837
udara dingin datang, panas terbawa.

82
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,890
Kenapa udara hangat naik?

83
00:05:30,067 --> 00:05:32,427
Ia lebih ringan dari udara dingin.

84
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:37,630
Jadi walau diam, panas terus terbawa.

85
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:41,420
Jaket hangat karena bulunya hangat?

86
00:05:42,333 --> 00:05:45,393
Bulu angsa menghantar panas mirip udara.

87
00:05:46,833 --> 00:05:48,113
Lihat dengan lup:

88
00:05:49,367 --> 00:05:53,827
ia seperti benang sangat
halus, mekar ke segala arah.

89
00:05:55,367 --> 00:05:58,667
Bersama-sama, ia membentuk
banyak ruang kecil.

90
00:06:00,167 --> 00:06:03,657
Udara terkunci di ruang
itu, tak bisa naik.

91
00:06:04,633 --> 00:06:07,243
Jadi pakai udara saja dong?

92
00:06:08,133 --> 00:06:11,083
Udara lepas berputar membawa panas.

93
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:15,240
Dalam kotak kecil, ia tak bisa berputar.

94
00:06:16,667 --> 00:06:19,700
Banyak kamar mungil!

95
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:23,200
Jaket bulu angsa itu baju penuh udara!

96
00:06:23,267 --> 00:06:25,097
Bagian paling cerdik:

97
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:28,900
bahan terpentingnya udara yang gratis.

98
00:06:30,167 --> 00:06:34,117
Sweter dan selimutmu juga
begitu: mengurung udara.

99
00:06:35,933 --> 00:06:37,673
Bulu kucing juga?

100
00:06:38,667 --> 00:06:41,347
Ya, bulu hewan juga mengurung udara.

101
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:45,443
Kalau jaketnya kutekan?

102
00:06:46,767 --> 00:06:49,857
Peluk erat, bagian itu jadi kempis.

103
00:06:50,967 --> 00:06:53,907
Kempis, udaranya berkurang,

104
00:06:54,167 --> 00:06:56,100
kurang hangat.

105
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,880
Kalau aku duduki?

106
00:06:58,867 --> 00:07:01,557
Bagian di bawah pantat paling kempis.

107
00:07:02,967 --> 00:07:06,447
Jadi makin berat dan tebal, makin hangat?

108
00:07:07,333 --> 00:07:08,873
Bukan berat.

109
00:07:09,233 --> 00:07:13,600
Yang penting, berapa udara diam di dalam.

110
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,210
Kalau kehujanan dan basah?

111
00:07:16,933 --> 00:07:19,273
Air mengisi ruang kecil itu,

112
00:07:20,033 --> 00:07:21,763
mengusir udaranya.

113
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:26,440
Air menghantar panas
dua puluhan kali udara.

114
00:07:27,267 --> 00:07:31,907
Begitu basah, panas kabur jauh
lebih cepat, kurang hangat.

115
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:36,990
Bulu basah kempis, ruangnya hilang.

116
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:39,350
Ingat dinginnya kehujanan, kan?

117
00:07:40,733 --> 00:07:43,263
Rambut basah juga dingin!

118
00:07:44,067 --> 00:07:48,357
Ya, air yang mengering juga
membawa panas dari tubuhmu.

119
00:07:49,567 --> 00:07:52,567
Kalau berangin, kok dingin sekali?

120
00:07:53,267 --> 00:07:55,397
Ingat udara hangat yang naik?

121
00:07:56,567 --> 00:07:58,837
Angin meniupnya duluan,

122
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:02,800
udara dingin berganti, panas kabur.

123
00:08:03,567 --> 00:08:06,277
Angin sering membawa
panas jauh lebih cepat.

124
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:13,750
Itulah wind chill: suhu sama,
berangin terasa lebih dingin.

125
00:08:14,567 --> 00:08:19,077
Itu soal kulit yang terbuka:
wajah, telinga, tangan.

126
00:08:20,467 --> 00:08:22,927
Pantas telingaku sakit!

127
00:08:23,567 --> 00:08:26,887
Kain luar jaket sebaiknya tahan angin,

128
00:08:27,733 --> 00:08:29,613
dan tak tembus hujan.

129
00:08:30,267 --> 00:08:32,107
Tembok angin!

130
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:34,000
Lupa ritsleting?

131
00:08:34,833 --> 00:08:38,333
Angin masuk, meniup udara hangatmu.

132
00:08:38,333 --> 00:08:41,383
Pasti pernah rasakan.

133
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,770
Termos tanpa listrik,

134
00:08:44,433 --> 00:08:46,623
kok air es tetap dingin?

135
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:50,700
Sebab termos dan jaket kerjanya sama.

136
00:08:51,767 --> 00:08:56,427
Tak memanaskan, tak mendinginkan,
cuma menghambat panas.

137
00:08:57,367 --> 00:09:01,747
Termos dua lapis, udara
di tengahnya hampir habis.

138
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:05,390
Jaket mengurung udara,

139
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:08,130
termos tak mau udara?

140
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:12,990
Ya. Di jaket udara diam,
panas masih merayap;

141
00:09:13,333 --> 00:09:16,903
di termos hampir kosong,
panas sulit lewat.

142
00:09:18,133 --> 00:09:20,533
Jadi termos jaket super?

143
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:25,200
Kira-kira, tapi tak bisa dipakai.

144
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:28,440
Mulutnya kayak ritsleting terbuka?

145
00:09:28,867 --> 00:09:33,377
Mirip. Mulutnya tak vakum,
banyak panas lolos di situ.

146
00:09:34,467 --> 00:09:39,200
Jadi sup tetap panas, air es tetap dingin!

147
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:44,090
Ya. Ingat sifat panas? Ke mana
ia lari, termos menghadang.

148
00:09:45,267 --> 00:09:47,887
Kalau dipakai saat panas?

149
00:09:48,367 --> 00:09:50,197
Tetap menahan.

150
00:09:50,300 --> 00:09:54,010
Cuma saat panas kamu tak mau, jadi gerah.

151
00:09:54,533 --> 00:09:57,103
Lalu es batu di jaket tadi?

152
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:01,150
Jaket kan hangat, pasti cepat meleleh?

153
00:10:01,667 --> 00:10:06,367
Banyak yang kira. Tapi tak ada pemanasnya,

154
00:10:06,367 --> 00:10:08,107
Ingat termometer semalam?
Jaketnya tak menghangat.

155
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,460
Di kelas sering dicoba:
satu dibungkus, satu tidak.

156
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,000
Yang dibungkus lebih awet.

157
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:22,533
Dibungkus malah lebih awet?!

158
00:10:22,533 --> 00:10:23,713
Paham!

159
00:10:23,867 --> 00:10:27,287
Hangat karena panasku ditahan jaket!

160
00:10:28,167 --> 00:10:31,033
Pakai lalu tunggu;

161
00:10:31,033 --> 00:10:34,363
sebentar itu, panasmu sedang mengisinya.

162
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:37,100
Oh, begitu!

163
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:41,180
Es krim di jaket, meleleh
lebih cepat atau lambat?

164
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:44,330
Tulis di komentar!

165
00:10:44,833 --> 00:10:49,623
Yuk cari 'kenapa' sehari-hari,
subscribe Kantor Oh Begitu.
